  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Zhao Lian Yun inherits Divine Concealment as a mortal otherworldly demon, Spirit Affinity House immortals Xu Hao and Li Jun Ying discuss Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable’s defensive pair with her. She also reports a clue that another Thieving Heaven inheritance about Ghostly Concealment is hidden in Luo Po Valley.",
      "chapters": [
        949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "move_divine_concealment",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "char_xu_hao",
        "char_li_jun_ying",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Feng Jiu Ge dies from the winds of assimilation, Zhao Lian Yun is left alone in the true inheritance space and quickly obtains Ghostly Concealment.",
      "chapters": [
        953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yuns-claim",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Feng Jiu Ge leaves the true inheritance space, a charming masculine voice from the darkness names itself Ben Jie Sun and offers Fang Yuan a gift called Ghostly Concealment; Fang Yuan then appears in Luo Po Valley under a layer of grey light.",
      "chapters": [
        991
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan obtains Ghostly Concealment in the Thieving Heaven true inheritance and finds his soul covered by a layer of dao marks, though he does not yet know what the move does. Finding no trace of Divine Concealment afterward, he wonders whether someone has already taken it.",
      "chapters": [
        992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unknown-use-no-trace-of-divine-concealment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan concludes from Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s song that Ghostly Concealment prevents detection by ghosts and souls, which is why Thieving Heaven could take Luo Po Valley and Dang Hun Mountain and travel the Obsession Death Domain without being restricted by endless souls.",
      "chapters": [
        1020
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "concealment-effect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "loc_obsession_death_domain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Tidal Dragon, one of three Central Continent rank eights fleeing a soul beast army, later names the pairing with Divine Concealment and repeats the rumor that a Gu Immortal with Ghostly Concealment would not be detected by soul beasts at all.",
      "chapters": [
        1244
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "concealment-effect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_myriad_tidal_dragon",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan passes himself off as Ying Wu Xie’s main body, but Ying Wu Xie feels none of the connection a split soul should have and exposes him. Fang Yuan reflects that Ghostly Concealment became a flaw, and that if he could use familiar face he should have been able to deceive Ying Wu Xie.",
      "chapters": [
        1021
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ghostly-concealment-as-a-flaw",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration states that Feng Jiu Ge died inside the Thieving Heaven true inheritance space in the previous life, and that Fang Yuan’s later use of Spring Autumn Cicada saved him and changed history.",
      "chapters": [
        1192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ges-death-in-the-previous-life",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mu Ling Lan states that Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable supposedly relied on Ghostly Concealment to enter the door of life and death and move Dang Hun Mountain and Luo Po Valley out, but could not take Reverse Flow River.",
      "chapters": [
        1252
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reverse-flow-river-and-the-door-of-life-and-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mu_ling_lan",
        "loc_reverse_flow_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan carries the move into the fight against the three ancient soul beasts Ying Wu Xie summons, and none of them can sense him. His battle strength already surpasses theirs, so that blindness hands him a huge superiority, and the soul beasts are severely injured before they can react.",
      "chapters": [
        1257
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blinding-the-soul-beasts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ghostly Concealment melds with its user and stays active at all times, a killer move that costs no immortal essence at all to keep running.",
      "chapters": [
        1365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "no-essence-cost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later states that of Thieving Heaven’s true inheritances, he inherited only Ghostly Concealment, while Divine Concealment was taken by Zhao Lian Yun.",
      "chapters": [
        1435
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-split",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun"
      ]
    }
  ],
